      "uid": "zhcn:a5a263aa52692a4a1622abfd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你是否有决心要与我朝相同的目标前进，\n实现这远大却无谋的梦想？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb170ae320b3de0e716286e1152de66b6ddb243553e563fcea193189997176d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1017/storytimeline_501017100.json",
